% Bibliography for paper/paper.tex.
%
% paper.tex prints its references from a hand-written `thebibliography`, which
% is what arXiv wants: a submission that carries no .bbl and needs no BibTeX
% pass. Journals want the opposite, a .bib they can run through their own style
% file, so both exist and `tests/test_paper_bibliography.py` binds them: same
% keys, same DOIs, in both directions. Editing one without the other fails the
% suite rather than shipping two reference lists that disagree.
%
% Every DOI here was resolved against Crossref rather than reconstructed from
% the volume and page. That check found one error: the symbolic-regression paper
% cited as Nucl. Fusion 55, 073009 is Plasma Phys. Control. Fusion 57, 014008.
% Nucl. Fusion 55, 073009 is a different Murari paper.
%
% Seven entries have no DOI and are not missing one: a 1975 Soviet journal, two
% NeurIPS proceedings papers, a laboratory research plan, the two EPS conference
% contributions (Europhysics Conference Abstracts are not registered with
% Crossref) and the OSF deposit (no DOI registered, checked against the OSF API;
% its GUID is the identifier). tests/test_paper_bibliography.py holds that list.

